    "updated_at": "2024-03-12T11:55:48Z",
    "body": "The big difference between media queries and support queries is that MQ are specified by the CSSWG in a language-agnostic way, while SQ are inherently tied to CSS and therefore are misplaced in an HTML attribute. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
