    "updated_at": "2024-11-07T06:46:30Z",
    "body": "> MQ are specified by the CSSWG in a language-agnostic way\r\n\r\nThis does not seem obvious as it uses the CSS value definition syntax and the CSS parser:\r\n\r\n> To parse a `<media-query-list>` production, [parse a comma-separated list of component values](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-syntax-3/#parse-a-comma-separated-list-of-component-values), then parse each entry in the returned list as a [`<media-query>`](https://drafts.csswg.org/mediaqueries-5/#typedef-media-query).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
