    "updated_at": "2024-11-10T07:41:53Z",
    "body": "I remember discussing this functionality with the CSS WG at some TPAC so I think there is at least some appetite for this. And how exactly features are organized or what their specification title is at the moment can all be re-arranged if the idea makes sense and has support.",
